 "remarks": "Not to be missed! Beautifully renovated end unit in the sought-after Canaan Square complex. Thoughtfully redesigned in 2023, this home offers a classic layout with a modern open floor plan. The stunning kitchen with all-new appliances flows seamlessly into a spacious living room, perfect for everyday living and entertaining. Another special feature is the year-round sunroom, which opens to a private terrace for outdoor enjoyment. This three bedroom, three and a half bath condo has a finished lower level full bath that provides additional flexible space. Filled with natural light, this bright and private unit also includes a detached garage. Plenty of parking. Ideally located, just a short walk to downtown New Canaan, Mead Park, Metro-North, and all the town's amenities.",
